  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">OKACOM 2014-2017; OKACOM 5-year plan institutional and organizational capacity - OKACOM Phase 2</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">OKACOM 2014-2017; OKACOM 5-&#xe5;rs plan f&#xf6;r institutionell kapacitetsutveckling</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till Okavango Basin Commission (OKACOM) f&#xf6;r en del av            fem&#xe5;rsplanen &amp; kapacitetsst&#xf6;d till sekretariatet. F&#xf6;rv&#xe4;ntade          resultat:i)st&#xe4;rkt sekretariat inom administration,                    kunskaps-hantering,policy &amp; prgramkoordinering,samt ii) ett gemensamt besluts- &amp; f&#xf6;rvaltningsramverk har etablerats inom                    f&#xf6;rs&#xf6;rjnings-m&#xf6;jligheter, vatten- och markf&#xf6;rvaltning,</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Okavanago Basin Commission (OKACOM) for part of their five year plan and capacity support to the secretariat. Expected results:  i)strengthened secretariat in administration, knowledge management,   policy analysis and programme coordination, and ii)a joint            decision-making and management framework established within           livelihoods, water and land management, environment, biodiversity.</narrative>
  </description>
